   - Open the `MyApi.csproj` file and add the following package reference:
     ```xml
     <ItemGroup>
       <PackageReference Include="Swashbuckle.AspNetCore" Version="6.2.3" />
     </ItemGroup>
     ```
   - Alternatively, you can add the package using the .NET CLI:
